            ...
        }
    }
}
```

Metadata is captured from pulldown-cmark YAML metadata blocks.

### 16. `MarkdownEventsReader::start_tag`

Relevant branch:

```rust
Tag::MetadataBlock(_) => self.metadata_block = true,
```

### 17. `MarkdownEventsReader::end_tag`

Relevant branch:

```rust
TagEnd::MetadataBlock(_) => self.metadata_block = false,
```

### 18. `MarkdownEventsReader::metadata`

```rust
